WEBVTT

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.910
Outstanding!

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.340
This feels so good...

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:45.850
Just how long do you intend
to relax and fool around?

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.510
What else can we do? The guy
we're dealing with isn't here yet.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.650
Hey, Lina!
When do we start dealing?

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.560
Tonight, okay? Tonight!

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:58.150
So let's have as much fun
as we can before then!

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:01.170
We have to find a way to fight
back against the Monsters...

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:04.200
...as soon as we can,
and she does this?

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:21.110
The info you want is right here.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:23.020
Knew I could count on you, Mr. Borden.

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:26.350
Only the man in charge of the
black market could've gotten this.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:28.050
So, what's inside?

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:33.220
A map telling the location of
the ruins of an ancient dynasty.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:37.530
A holy ultimate spell of divine
protection is hidden there.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.940
So... What kinda spell is it?

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:44.240
My job ends here. I'm not in
business to go treasure hunting.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:48.040
Okay. Nothing I can do
except try my best, then.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:50.340
In that case, the price is
one hundred thousand in cash now.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.950
You're kidding, right?
We'll give you ten thousand first...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:58.250
...and if the spell's real, we'll
give you the other ninety thousand.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.260
Don't be ridiculous!
This cost me a lot of money!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:04.520
You'd better give me the full
payment of one hundred thousand now!

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:08.230
If there's no spell book, that scrap
of paper isn't worth anything.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.430
That's why I said I'd pay
you ten thousand in advance!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.870
Just take the deal,
you old octopus!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:17.810
You'd better show more
respect to the name of Borden!

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.600
Okay, fine. If that's how
you want to play this game...

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.940
FIREBALL!

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:37.560
Okay, there's your full payment
of ten thousand for the map.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.820
Full payment?!
Don't you mean my advance?!

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:41.720
Full... pay... ment!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.100
I understand!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.100
Weren't you a
little rough on him?

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:48.610
That kind of guy deserves it!

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:51.610
Exactly! I hear nothing
but bad rumors about him!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.800
Never mind! Just get
your clothes on already!

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:58.620
Curse you, Lina Inverse! Don't
assume you've heard the last of me!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.150
Oh, man...

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.690
How many times have
we been through here?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:09.590
I've forgotten how many times since
we came into this jungle three days ago.

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:11.750
Well, it's not like it's my fault!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.200
This thing's like a treasure map!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.890
They wanted to
keep these ruins hidden!

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.600
So, what do we do now?

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:22.200
It says there's a lady's profile
as a landmark... But where?

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:25.710
Amelia! Do you see anything?

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:32.410
Okay... A lady's profile...
A lady's profile...

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.680
I don't see anything!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.850
Oh... I dunno what
explorer drew this thing...

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.750
...but he should
have made it easier!

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:43.620
There's no point to a treasure map
that lets you find things easily.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.720
I think so, too.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.790
And you guys should
help out, you know!

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:49.660
Well, we'll handle
things here, then.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.330
Huh? Handle things here?

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:01.110
We found 'em! The guys who
double-crossed Mr. Borden!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.940
I heard you were sorta good,
but that won't help you now!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.920
Understand?! We're Mr. Borden's...

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.050
FIREBALL!

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.130
Ah, that felt good.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:17.820
H- Hey!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:20.300
Thanks to that, I'm not
in such a bad mood now.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.800
Anyway, let's get back
to solving this puzzle.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.630
What about us?

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:31.000
This mountain ridge
looks like a lady's profile.

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:33.900
We're aiming for the
nape of the lady's neck.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.970
We can probably find the
next landmark from there...

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.980
Oh, for crying out...
Where is it?

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:45.250
Okay, a lady's profile...

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:53.130
A lady's profile?

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:58.470
- The nape of the neck?
- The ruins of the ancient dynasty?

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:02.030
The spell book
they hid away, right?

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:06.170
Look, I don't know how
you found out about this...

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.010
...but this spell
belongs to ME, okay?!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:12.020
Oh, no, it doesn't!
We need to get it, too!

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:15.250
My sister and I have been
through a lot of trouble for this!

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:17.790
We've also been through
a lot of trouble for this!

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.880
This map cost us a lot of money!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.690
It was expensive for US, too!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.320
WE had to pay five
thousand for this lousy old map!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:30.270
Five thousand?! Where'd you
get it for that little money?!

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.530
There's no way we'd tell you!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.660
So, you'd better
just give up and leave!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.040
Hmpf! You're the ones who
should give up and leave!

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.510
You dare stand against I, Mimi...

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.170
...and her sister, Nene?!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.650
You've got a lot of nerve!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.680
If that's how you want it,
let's get going now!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:48.880
What should we do?

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.850
Leave this stupid fight to her.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.560
I guess.
You heard him, Lina.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.120
You heard him.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:56.990
What do you mean,
"you heard him"?!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:57.720
Now!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.020
Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:05.130
That's your fault
for not paying attention!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:10.330
Those who use treacherous
tactics are those people call evil!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.600
What's with her?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.610
Those who smash evil
are those people call...

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:15.370
Shut up!

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.370
...the Hammer of Justice!!!

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.210
All right! Let's go, Amelia!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.150
Right!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:28.520
Oh, stop complaining! First of all,
we didn't do anything unfair!

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.550
Seyruun Tornado!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.300
Fireball!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:45.540
This is an enchanted fan! And you've
seen our martial arts skill!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.640
If you're gonna leave,
now's the time!

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.380
No, now's the time
for YOU guys to leave!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.110
We're not leaving!

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:55.350
Then I'll MAKE you give up!

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.250
Bomb Spirit!

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.450
Hien Sen Puuda!

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.490
Elmekia Lance!

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.130
Ho-Oh Ranbu Kick!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:10.160
Those other girls
are pretty good.

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.900
What? What is it?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.340
Well, it's just that this rock...

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.170
You guys are pretty good!

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.210
So are you!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.350
Whoa...
There's a hidden doorway here.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.510
All right! You did it, Gourry!

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:30.490
Diem Wing!

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.860
Ray Wing!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.360
Hey! No fair!

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.420
Wait for us!

00:08:58.450 --> 00:08:59.970
What is this place?

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:02.880
Um... That's a good question.

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.050
Oh! Miss Lina!

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.180
Look at that!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.560
An entrance...
Yeah... We've done it!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.470
This is it!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.190
The spell book's in
these underground ruins!

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:19.760
Oh... So, let's go in.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.380
Balus Wall!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.340
What was that just now?!

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:44.160
Who's this guy?
The guardian of the ruins?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.590
No, Lina Inverse!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.090
You're a Monster, right?

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:53.630
In Lord Gaav's name,
I've come for your life!

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:57.770
Oh, for the love of!
Why'd you have to show up NOW?!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:59.710
Darn it! Darn it!
Get out of our way!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.380
Here we go!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.450
Oh, you're just weird, pal!

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.790
What's so funny?!

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:24.430
Darn it! I missed!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.030
You won't escape this time!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.730
Yikes! They followed us in!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.300
Now get out of here!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.000
Anything in those
ruins belongs to us!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.040
Fireball!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.380
At last, we've found you!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.650
I can do sorcery, too! This place
will now become your grave site!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.680
Flare Arrow!

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:54.320
For God's sake...
I'm sick of these stupid games!

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.970
Let's find that spell book already!

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.900
Great, a dead end.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.400
Hm... Hang on a sec.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:26.140
When you run into the wall,
applying some force to it...

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.540
Justice Shoulder Attack!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.070
...is NOT what you want to do.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:33.440
Hey, are you okay?

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:38.380
I'm okay because I cast a
levitation spell fast enough, but...

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.420
Miss Lina!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.720
That's why it said
not to push on it...

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.630
Which way?

00:11:56.710 --> 00:12:00.640
If we go into the left hallway,
there are traps waiting.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:05.110
As we go into the middle hallway,
there's a button on the right wall.

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:06.200
Found it!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.510
Do not push this.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.180
I just did.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:19.190
Okay, what's next?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.390
On the right wall,
you'll see a button.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.490
Which I won't push.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:25.360
Do not walk past
without pushing it.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.490
I just walked past it...

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:34.240
Would you WAIT till I finish
reading before doing anything?!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.380
NOW you tell me...

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:43.740
For crying out loud, where is it?!
All we keep finding are empty rooms!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.250
Doesn't the map say
anything about that?

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:49.620
The map stopped telling
me stuff a while ago.

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:53.150
Whoever drew it only got
as far as the upper levels.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.960
AH! Miss Lina! Over there!

00:12:56.970 --> 00:13:00.420
Whoa! That's definitely
worth investigating!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.640
We did it!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:10.680
This is the spell book, isn't it?

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.780
A book on the holy
god of Shrine Maidens?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:17.380
I should have known it
wouldn't be the Claire Bible!

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:21.910
Who cares? All we heard was that
it contains powerful magic spells.

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:23.980
What's this?

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.190
It looks like some sort of costume.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:30.530
"Those who seek the god's holy
power must wear the holy robes."

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:34.470
Looks like whoever wants
to cast the spell has to wear that.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.970
Huh?! THIS thing?!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.300
There's another one in here.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.870
Two people have to recite
the spell, which is pretty long...

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:46.780
...while performing movements
with their arms and legs.

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:48.210
Oh, what a pain...

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.620
Those belong to us!

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:55.220
What?! You guys again?! Huh?

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.190
We've found you!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.950
And this time, we really WILL
make this your graveyard!

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:06.200
You may have caught me off
guard before, but not this time!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:07.900
Why does this have to happen?!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.700
First, I'll start with you two,
who dared to attack me!

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.240
W- We're not with them!

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:16.400
N- Neither are we!

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.650
Go!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:22.640
Damn it!

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:25.280
In that case, let's do it!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.650
Embu Toh-ketsu HA!

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:31.180
Flare Arrow!

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:42.900
Stand aside!

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:44.530
No way, pal!

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.470
Fireball!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.710
Hah! Spells won't work on me!

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.110
Looks like my sword
works against them!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.150
But how long can you hold out?

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:00.920
What's wrong?!

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:02.480
They won't die!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.620
Dammit! Get away, you!

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.090
He may look ridiculous,
but he's still a Monster!

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.390
Hold it!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.260
Let's try this spell!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:16.270
Are you serious? We don't
know what effect it'll have.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:18.600
It's supposed to be a holy
spell of divine protection.

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.800
I think it'll
work against a Monster.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.310
Okay, Miss Lina! Here!

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.750
What do you mean, "here"?!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:30.180
You have to wear that
to cast it! Do your best!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.380
What are you talking about?
You have to do it, too!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.290
Huh?! Me, too?!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.220
Two people have
to chant it, right?

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.820
Oh! There's no
end to these things!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.690
What did we do to deserve this?!

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:55.780
Hey! Cut it out!
Don't look at me!

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:01.620
Don't look!
Turn around! Don't look!

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:03.120
Let's do it, Miss Lina.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.950
Girls who are in love
give their love to you.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:10.620
You, who shine so bright, my darling.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.580
What's the next part?

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:14.220
Wait a second...

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:17.790
Shining rouge, pink like peaches...

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:21.430
Shining rouge, pink like peaches...

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:23.500
Th- That's... That's...

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.230
That's our stuff!

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:29.000
I pray that it reaches you,
this young girl's prayer.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:33.070
I pray that it reaches you,
this young girl's prayer.

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:37.080
Floating in the night sky,
like a silver boat.

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:41.020
The moon reflects my
tears of love and hate.

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:43.760
Dammit, why do
I have to do this?!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.890
Floating in the night sky,
like a silver boat.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:51.830
The moon reflects my
tears of love and hate.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.700
Hey, at least you don't have to
wear these ridiculous getups!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:56.530
I'm so embarrassed I could die!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:03.470
My heart's beating so fast
inside my little breast!

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:06.980
My heart's beating so fast
inside my little breast!

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.020
And is it ever little...

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:13.950
My heart's flying, flying to you!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.690
Oh, please, will it reach you?
This young girl's prayer.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:21.390
I'm yours completely,
pretty little me!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.160
You're not pretty.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:23.990
SHUT UP!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.760
Here it is! Here it is!
This is it! This is it!

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:42.410
Well?

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.500
I don't feel any
different, do you?

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:49.080
Don't tell me... Don't tell
me that thing just now was it!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:50.950
Uh... That thing
just now wasn't it?

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.180
You want to try another song?

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.850
Are you kidding?! I've had it!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.390
Some big, ultimate holy
spell of divine protection!

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.620
It isn't an ultimate
spell of anything.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.360
They're lost festival dances.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:06.060
F- Festival dances?

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:08.760
Dances and songs
to honor the ancient gods.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.700
Melodies to summon
the holy light and stuff.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:17.510
Oh, man! I was wondering what
you were trying! What an idiot!

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:20.170
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows."

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.240
Uh, Lina?

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:25.480
"ln thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness!"

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:27.590
Hey, you're not gonna...

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.590
"...by the power you and I possess!"

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.750
I have HAD it!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.320
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.900
N- No fair...

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:56.140
Shut up! It's a small price to pay for
letting you watch me sing and dance!

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.650
That's Miss Lina for you.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.480
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.890
We can really keep these?

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:03.220
Do what you want with them.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:07.020
What a lifesaver! Now we'll
become famous singers!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.720
Well, let's go, Nene!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.060
We have to find
some town to perform in!

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.500
Bye! And thank you!

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.960
Dammit!
Now I'm out ten thousand!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:22.240
Girls who are in love
give their love to you.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:25.680
You, who shine so bright, my darling.

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:31.270
M- Martina! Xellos!
Where'd you come from?!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:36.160
Oh... We were also on the
trail of the Claire Bible.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.160
Of course, we saw something
much more interesting.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.460
My heart's beating so fast
inside my little breast!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.900
Y- You saw that?

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.070
I now know your weakness!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.870
A one-way ticket boomerang!

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.140
I'll MAKE you forget it!

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.910
Huh? W- Wait! Wait!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.740
DRAGON SLAVE!!!
